      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "五年，遷中護軍。",
      "reading": "普通五年遷中護軍。梁武紀繫正月。",
      "note": "普通五年遷中護軍。梁武紀繫正月。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 449,
      "end_codepoint": 457,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "六年，大舉北伐。",
      "reading": "六年承普通五年，即普通六年北伐。",
      "note": "六年承普通五年，即普通六年北伐。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 8,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-8",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "先遣豫州刺史裴邃帥譙州刺史湛僧智、歷陽太守明紹世、南譙太守魚弘、晉熙太守張澄，並世之驍將，自南道伐壽陽城，未克而邃卒。",
      "reading": "裴邃率湛僧智、明紹世、魚弘、張澄等從南道攻壽陽，未克而邃卒。這裡明承普通六年。",
      "note": "裴邃率湛僧智、明紹世、魚弘、張澄等從南道攻壽陽，未克而邃卒。這裡明承普通六年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 8,
      "end_codepoint": 67,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-67",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "乃加亶使持節，馳驛代邃，與魏將河間王元琛、臨淮王元彧等相拒，頻戰克捷。",
      "reading": "亶奉命代邃。河間王元琛與臨淮王元彧是北魏諸將。",
      "note": "亶奉命代邃。河間王元琛與臨淮王元彧是北魏諸將。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 67,
      "end_codepoint": 102,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-102",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "尋有密敕，班師合肥，以休士馬，須堰成復進。",
      "reading": "密敕班師合肥待堰，通鑑作夏侯但。",
      "note": "密敕班師合肥待堰，通鑑作夏侯但。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 102,
      "end_codepoint": 123,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-123",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "七年夏，淮堰水盛，壽陽城將沒，高祖復遣北道軍元樹帥彭寶孫、陳慶之等稍進，亶帥湛僧智、魚弘、張澄等通清流澗，將入淮、肥。",
      "reading": "普通七年夏水盛，元樹、彭寶孫、陳慶之屬北道，亶領諸將由清流澗而進。",
      "note": "普通七年夏水盛，元樹、彭寶孫、陳慶之屬北道，亶領諸將由清流澗而進。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 123,
      "end_codepoint": 182,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-182",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "魏軍夾肥築城，出亶軍後，亶與僧智還襲，破之。",
      "reading": "亶與湛僧智還襲魏城。",
      "note": "亶與湛僧智還襲魏城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 182,
      "end_codepoint": 204,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-204",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "進攻黎漿，貞威將軍韋放自北道會焉。",
      "reading": "韋放從北道來會。",
      "note": "韋放從北道來會。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 204,
      "end_codepoint": 221,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-221",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "兩軍既合，所向皆降下。",
      "reading": "兩軍會師後多降。",
      "note": "兩軍會師後多降。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 221,
      "end_codepoint": 232,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-232",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "凡降城五十二，獲男女口七萬五千人，米二十萬石。",
      "reading": "數字原錄。獲男女口之口，殿本無。",
      "note": "數字原錄。獲男女口之口，殿本無。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 232,
      "end_codepoint": 255,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-255",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "詔以壽陽依前代置豫州，合肥鎮改爲南豫州，以亶爲使持節、都督豫州緣淮南豫霍義定五州諸軍事、雲麾將軍、豫、南豫二州刺史。",
      "reading": "置豫州及南豫州，均由亶為刺史。",
      "note": "置豫州及南豫州，均由亶為刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 255,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-313",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "壽春久罹兵荒，百姓多流散，亶輕刑薄賦，務農省役，頃之民戶充復。",
      "reading": "壽春久經兵事後，亶省役勸農。",
      "note": "壽春久經兵事後，亶省役勸農。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 344,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-344",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "大通二年，進號平北將軍。",
      "reading": "大通二年進號平北將軍。",
      "note": "大通二年進號平北將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 344,
      "end_codepoint": 356,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-356",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "三年，卒於州鎮。",
      "reading": "三年卒，沿用本傳相對字形。梁武紀大通二年後另題中大通元年。",
      "note": "三年卒，沿用本傳相對字形。梁武紀大通二年後另題中大通元年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 356,
      "end_codepoint": 364,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence2-364",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "高祖聞之，卽日素服舉哀，贈車騎將軍。",
      "reading": "梁武帝素服舉哀，追贈車騎將軍。",
