      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "州民夏侯簡等五百人表請爲亶立碑置祠，詔許之。",
      "reading": "壽陽州民夏侯簡請立碑祠。夏侯簡與傳主關係無明文。",
      "note": "壽陽州民夏侯簡請立碑祠。夏侯簡與傳主關係無明文。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 386,
      "end_codepoint": 408,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_A",
      "source_quote": "亶爲人美風儀，寬厚有器量，涉獵文史，辯給能專對。",
      "reading": "評風儀、器量及善應對。",
      "note": "評風儀、器量及善應對。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
