      "note": "數位作稟答。殿本、南史皆見亶答，發言人為亶，自稱從弟。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 59,
      "end_codepoint": 70,
